{{Passive skill box|Unhallowed Rite}}

'''Unhallowed Rite''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Occultist]]. It grants a stack of Spirit Infusion while [[channelling]] a [[spell]], which grants faster [[energy shield]] recharge, more damage with channeling spells, and more [[cost]]. Spirit Infusion stacks are lost after not gaining any in the last 4 seconds.

==Mechanics==
Each stack of Spirit Infusion grants 15% faster start of Energy Shield Recharge, Channelling Spells deal 5% more Damage and Channelling Spells have 10% more [[Cost]]. Maximum of 10 stacks. You lose one stack every 0.5 seconds if you have not gained a stack in the past 4 seconds.

